  "label": "Bass drop in music",
  "description": "The phrase 'when the bass drops just right' refers to a musical term in electronic dance music (EDM) and hip-hop where a sudden, powerful low-frequency sound (the bass drop) occurs, often triggering an energetic reaction from the audience. This cultural phenomenon is not visible in the image but is essential to understand the meme's humor — the man's exaggerated dance is a comedic reaction to this specific musical event.",
